#lang scribble/manual
@title[#:tag "part-reference" #:style '(toc grouper)]{Reference}

Look up a name, argument, result, or restriction here. The Scene API is divided
by task; it is no longer a single chapter called Quick Start. That short
introduction is now at @secref["guide-getting-started"].

The API definitions and their links are retained. Detailed model rules are in
@secref["model"], after the common Scene and animation operations.
